  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖冷却水泵、冷却器、温控阀等关键设备选型应满足主机厂家、船级社和项目技术规格书要求。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="1">
    <Requirement id="ER-P009-01" level="1" requirementType="configuration">
      <sysml:Name>关键设备选型合规性</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>冷却水泵、冷却器、温控阀等关键设备的选型应满足主机厂家、船级社和项目技术规格书的要求。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="review" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P009" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-CCS-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-IACS-M3-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SOLAS-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-DNV-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>设备选型不满足要求可能导致冷却能力不足、系统可靠性降低，无法通过船级社审批。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>审查设备选型计算书和规格书，确认冷却水泵台数、容量、驱动方式符合船级社规则（如CCS、IACS、SOLAS）和主机厂家要求。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>审查冷却器热平衡计算，确认冷却能力满足主机额定工况要求。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>审查温控阀选型，确认其温度控制范围满足主机厂家和DNV规则要求。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>所有设备选型文件应经船级社审批。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【关键设备选型合规性】，来自原始需求「满足主机厂家、船级社和项目技术规格书要求」。E-CCS-COOL-001 支撑了冷却水泵容量和冗余要求；E-IACS-M3-001 支撑了冷却水泵数量和容量要求；E-SOLAS-COOL-001 支撑了冗余和报警要求；E-DNV-COOL-001 支撑了温控阀温度控制要求。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
